  "One quiet morning, a small gray snail looked up at a slow white cloud.": "audio/b51de897dd3f.mp3",
  "Where are you going today, asked the snail. Nowhere in a hurry, said the cloud.": "audio/ba53672203a8.mp3",
  "So they both rested in the warm meadow until teatime. The end.": "audio/2b8589a37720.mp3",
