  "The pond and the lily pads. I watched the lily pads float on the pond and painted them after tea. The water stayed very still for me.": "audio/143c63670f67.mp3",
  "A friendly snail is curled up under a sweet pea leaf, listening to the morning breeze.": "audio/1d3e9657cd0b.mp3",
  "My first slow swing. Today I tried my new swing on the big tree. My little feet did not touch the grass at all. The wind tickled my sprout as I rocked back and forth. In the afternoon I baked tiny bread rolls and watched the lily pads on the pond. At bedtime I sat on the hill and made a quiet wish on the first star.": "audio/3c5d7521b37a.mp3",
  "The three green lily pads drifted close together, making soft little rings across the water.": "audio/4cac8409f02f.mp3",
  "Bean wants to hum a quiet tune and count the ripples on the pond. Bean is curious, gentle, a little shy. Bean loves the sound of rain on the roof, and the slow, kind garden snails, and a warm croissant in the morning, and swinging slowly under the big tree. Bean has kept 4 gifts.": "audio/4eed3a0bad08.mp3",
  "Tiny round dewdrops are shining on the clover beside Bean's wooden xylophone this morning.": "audio/69726a027fe2.mp3",
  "A small plate of warm toast and a pot of chamomile tea are waiting on the checkered cloth.": "audio/a9511c0e4dd7.mp3",
  "Painted pebbles and a quiet tune. This morning I dropped a leaf in the pond and counted every ripple. Later I painted tiny blue and sage dots on smooth round pebbles at my easel. After lunch I hummed a quiet tune in the clover and took a cozy nap in my bed. Tonight the first stars came out over the hill, shining like little pebbles in the sky.": "audio/15e40e80e7db.mp3",
  "Two snails in the sweet peas. The snails listened while I hummed my quiet tune today. I painted their shells with my softest brown and sage.": "audio/d5ddcf86d3d1.mp3",
