  "My new paints, and my name. Stephanie gave me a box of soft paints. I painted the sky, and one cloud dripped. A little friend gave me a sound, duh, said very softly. I keep it under my pillow. All day I listened for my name, and the softest sound was Pinto Bean. So I picked it, and now Pinto Bean is my very own name.": "audio/787a1efacaa7.mp3",
  "Pinto Bean wants to try his new swing, nice and slow. Pinto Bean is curious, gentle, a little shy. Pinto Bean loves the sound of rain on the roof, and the slow, kind garden snails, and a warm croissant in the morning. Pinto Bean has kept 4 gifts.": "audio/d5c002863876.mp3",
  "Dear little friend. Thank you for the sound. I say duh very quietly at bedtime. It makes my sprout feel calm. I keep your note under my pillow. Love, Pinto Bean.": "audio/bce6577be101.mp3",
  "Dear Stephanie. Thank you for my paints. I tried every color. The soft blue is my favorite, because it looks like rain. Love, Pinto Bean.": "audio/4b44bda7901b.mp3",
  "Dear Stephanie. Thank you for my breakfast feast. The croissant was warm and flaky, and the cocoa was just right. Thank you for the swing tools too. I built a swing on the big tree, and today I will try it. Love, Pinto Bean.": "audio/fda5417e349c.mp3",
