  "A ribbon of soft morning mist is drifting slowly past the top of the grassy hill.": "audio/25132dcba447.mp3",
  "A fresh little loaf of bread is cooling on a cream linen napkin at the bakery window.": "audio/5b42f064160f.mp3",
  "Pinto Bean wants to bake tiny warm bread and read a picture book under the big tree. Pinto Bean is curious, gentle, a little shy. Pinto Bean loves the sound of rain on the roof, and the slow, kind garden snails, and a warm croissant in the morning, and swinging slowly under the big tree. Pinto Bean has kept 4 gifts.": "audio/ca5f3da558fe.mp3",
  "The first stars over the hill. I painted the quiet hill just as the sky turned dusty blue and lavender. My yellow brush made four little stars above the cloud.": "audio/dc26aa667517.mp3",
  "The pond water is so calm this morning that a fluffy white cloud is reflected right beside the lily pads.": "audio/e837ecd4ae96.mp3",
  "Warm bread and the first stars. First thing this morning I baked a tiny loaf of bread at the bakery window. Later I swung nice and slow under the big tree and picked sweet peas in the garden. In the afternoon I painted the sky at my easel and read a picture book in the shade. At dusk I carried a warm roll up the hill and made a quiet wish on the first two stars.": "audio/f5c29b07cc8e.mp3",
  "Pinto wiggles his tiny stubby feet and feels happy.": "audio/4a58eed84b65.mp3",
