  "Pinto tilts his head and smiles at your painting. He loves the soft colors you chose.": "audio/30c1a3c5e553.mp3",
  "Mmm, something's baking. Pinto follows the smell of fresh bread right to the little shop on the hill.": "audio/e8e329f5f5a0.mp3",
  "A fresh canvas, waiting at the easel. There's no wrong way to paint, only Pinto's way. And when you're ready, a soft tune on the xylophone.": "audio/c3c115a758bf.mp3",
